{"name": "Souper Bloody", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Gameplay Video\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/98bcdf9080ce625f303c70d148ab7982.poster.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/98bcdf9080ce625f303c70d148ab7982.webm?t=1774636811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/98bcdf9080ce625f303c70d148ab7982.mp4?t=1774636811\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They wanted to summon their god. They got a nightmare. Now, it's time to make them into a stew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Souper Bloody is a rougelite hack-and-slash where you play as a demon from the lowest layer of the Underlasagne. You can only move around in the blood of your enemies, so get slashing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Meet Xylo\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/5ab32fdddfce06a452cccd00810baa3d.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xylo (full name Xylo William Phone) is a demon living comfortably in the lowest layer of the Underlasagne until one day he gets accidentally summoned to the surface by the vegetable cult. Understandably cranky, he kills each and every piece of food on his way back down to the core of the Underlasagne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Unlimited Power\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/e28e49b615e3109d55d634c43ca46491.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLAY as a demon seeking revenge on the food cults of the Underlasagne!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Xylo attackind a Carrotten\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/a18d468a9325a27977016cf01284a68d.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FIGHT cults of rotten vegetables and other foods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"A cult of vegetables\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/2d912c80a72c84d7938402efaf96d003.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UPGRADE your stats in between runs and find perks while battling!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"The dish upgrade menu and a Sugar Cuber spice\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/ff2400a70d41142ccf5ab82e109da5c6.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DESCEND the layers of the Underlasagne!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"in-game room chooser\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/8fa2b6ca4d9f1fbd30612488c03dcff8.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BECOME John Souper Bloody!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"A very angry Xylo\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"329\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/efd265898211ddbee4a93da0daa25ef7.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"About DAE\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/extras/a63dfcf9355462edc0ad0fd0cbcf3382.avif?t=1774636811\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made by 6 students as a group project assignment for their third year in the bachelor Digital Arts &amp; Entertainment at Hogeschool West-Vlaanderen in Belgium. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music was composed by Joshua Mas, student at the\u00a0Royal Conservatoire of Ghent. The narrative was written by\u00a0Elise Himbaza Iradukunda, student at the Royal Institute for Theatre, Cinema and Sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Slaughter the vegetables that accidentally summoned your demonic self in this devilishly tasty action-packed roguelite hack-and-slash! Upgrade your attacks and gain new spicy powers every run while exploring the depths of the Underlasagne.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368980/5f7d6670a6d150186244c10985de7b772abec2df/header.jpg?t=1774636811", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Hack and Slash", "Action", "Dungeon Crawler", "Beat 'em up", "PvE"], "developers": "Jelle Rubbens, 